#% title
# smooth_histogram

#% text
# `smooth_histogram(data)` draws a smooth estimate of the data's density: a sum of Gaussian kernels with Silverman's bandwidth.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# Several data sets give several curves.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
smooth_histogram([1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3, 4, 5, 7])
